# horowitz.law — _redirects (Cloudflare Pages)
#
# Note: Pages `_redirects` sources are path-based; a host-based rule for the
# *.pages.dev origin is not supported here (an earlier revision of this file
# carried one, which deployed but was inert). The pages.dev -> apex 301 lives
# in functions/_middleware.js instead.

# Optional short alias for the contact vCard. Not required by the current QR
# code (it encodes the canonical /devin-horowitz.vcf); useful only if a
# smaller V3-Q symbol is ever wanted.
# /dh.vcf /devin-horowitz.vcf 301
/C /contact.vcf 301

# The pipeline doc lives in the repo at docs/PIPELINE.md and is not deployed to the site root, so
# the colophon's terminal-style `cat /PIPELINE.md` link 404'd. Serve it by redirecting to the
# canonical copy on GitHub (rendered there), which keeps the site-relative link working.
/PIPELINE.md https://github.com/devinhorowitz/horowitz.law/blob/main/docs/PIPELINE.md 302
